    "填写 homeserver 地址与访问令牌，或者用户 ID 与密码，即可让机器人以 CS API 长轮询接收消息并以富文本回复。": "Enter the homeserver URL with an access token, or a user id with a password, and the bot receives các tin nhắn over the CS API long poll and replies with rich text.",
    "填写 homeserver 地址，并提供访问令牌，或者用户 ID 与密码的组合。机器人只访问该 homeserver，不连接第三方服务器。": "Enter the homeserver URL plus an access token, or a user id with a password. The bot only talks to that homeserver and never to third-party servers.",
