    "增强提示词": "Guidance",
    "增强提示词中请使用字段名（如 senderId、conversationType）引用这些信息。只发送勾选且当前消息中可用的字段，不会额外查询或补全。": "Reference these values by field tên (such as senderId or conversationType) in the guidance. Only đã chọn fields available in the current tin nhắn are sent; no extra lookups are made.",
    "增强提示词中请使用字段名（如 senderId、conversationType）引用这些信息。只发送当前会话中勾选且可用的字段，不会额外查询或补全。": "Reference these values by field tên (such as senderId or conversationType) in the guidance. Only fields đã chọn and available in the current cuộc trò chuyện are sent; no extra lookups are made.",
    "增量添加当前缺少的卡片回调 card.action.trigger、读取消息内图片或文件所需的 im:message:readonly（飞书显示为“获取单聊、群组消息”）、上传机器人图片或文件所需的 im:resource，以及原生命令面板所需的 application:app_slash_command:read / write；确认页只显示当前缺少项，不会创建新应用。": "Thẻ · action · trigger im message readonly im resource application app slash lệnh đọc write",
