    "开启后，在群聊或私聊里 @机器人 提问，机器人会在那条消息下新建一个飞书话题并在话题内回答；该话题是一条独立会话，话题里的后续消息都属于同一个会话。只发一个 @机器人（打开菜单）不会新建话题，没有 @机器人 的消息也留在原来的会话里。": "When enabled, mentioning the bot in a group or a Trò chuyện riêng tư opens a dedicated Feishu topic under that message and the Câu trả lời stays inside it. That topic is an independent conversation in dsh, and later messages in the topic belong to the same conversation. A bare \"@bot\" (which opens the menu) opens no topic, and messages without a mention stay in the chat's own conversation.",
