    "当前 Host 不支持更新接口，请先手动更新插件并重启。": "This Host does not support the cập nhật API. Cập nhật the plugin manually and khởi động lại first.",
    "当前 Host 的 Node.js 版本不满足新版要求，请先更新运行环境。": "The Host Node.js phiên bản does not meet the new phiên bản’s requirements. Cập nhật the runtime first.",
    "当前 npm 源配置与官方源不一致，请先检查 registry 配置。": "The npm registry cấu hình differs from the chính thức registry. Check your registry cài đặt first.",
    "当前二维码有效时间": "Mã qr expires in",
    "当前地址与浏览器的本机请求校验不兼容。请使用上方按钮改用 localhost 重新打开。": "This address is incompatible with the trình duyệt’s local-request checks. Use the button above to reopen with localhost.",
    "当前工作区": "Current không gian làm việc",
    "当前插件安装不完整或与 profile 不符，请手动检查安装配置。": "The plugin installation is incomplete or does not match this profile. Check the installation cấu hình manually.",
    "当前是源码或链接安装，只能检查版本；请手动更新源码，或迁移到 npm 安装。": "This is a source or linked installation. You can check các phiên bản, but must cập nhật the source manually or migrate to an npm installation.",
    "当前机器人": "Current bot",
    "当前模型不支持图片，请用 /models 查看可用模型，再用 /model <序号> 切换后重发。": "The current mô hình does not support images. Use /các mô hình to list available các mô hình, switch with /mô hình <number>, then resend.",
    "当前模型不支持所选思考强度，请重新选择。": "This mô hình does not support the đã chọn suy luận effort. Chọn another effort.",
    "当前模型已不可用，请选择其他模型或跟随默认模型。": "The current mô hình is unavailable. Chọn another mô hình or follow the mặc định.",
    "当前没有白名单用户，保存后普通用户将无法使用机器人。": "There are currently no allowlisted users. After đang lưu, regular users will not be able to use the bot.",
    "当前没有选择任何指令，保存后「/」面板会变成空的。": "No các lệnh are đã chọn; đang lưu leaves the \"/\" panel empty.",
    "当前浏览器不支持自动复制，请手动选择复制。": "Automatic copy is unavailable. Chọn and copy the value manually.",
    "当前消息的发送时间，格式为 YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss（本机时区）。优先使用平台给出的发送时间；平台未提供时，从微信消息 ID 中解析出发送时间；两者都不可用时，即使已选择该字段，<dsh_im_source> 中也会省略 sentAt。目前仅微信渠道提供；把本机时区写进增强提示词，模型判断先后顺序时更准确。": "When the current tin nhắn was sent, as YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss in the local time zone. The platform send time is used when available; otherwise the send time is decoded from the WeChat tin nhắn ID. If neither is available, <dsh_im_source> omits sentAt even when the field is đã chọn. WeChat is the only kênh that provides it hôm nay. Naming your time zone in the guidance makes ordering judgements more accurate.",
    "当前渠道不支持群聊": "Nhóm chat is not supported by this kênh",
    "当前渠道暂不支持投递目标。": "Delivery targets are not supported for this kênh.",
    "当前渠道暂不支持访问设置。": "Access cài đặt are not supported by this kênh yet.",
    "当前版本": "Current phiên bản",
    "当前版本无需更新": "Không có newer phiên bản nào khả dụng",
    "当前目录": "Current thư mục",
    "当前运行环境不支持按钮安装，请手动更新插件。": "This runtime cannot cài đặt through this button. Cập nhật the plugin manually.",
    "当前配置版本不允许此字段。": "Phiên bản cấu hình hiện tại không cho phép trường này.",
    "待手动重启": "Khởi động lại needed",
    "微信": "Weixin",
    "微信二维码已生成，请使用手机微信扫描。": "WeChat Mã qr generated. Scan it with WeChat on your phone.",
    "微信初始化失败，请查看 DSH 启动日志。": "WeChat initialization thất bại. Check the DSH startup logs.",
    "微信已授权，但 Harness 健康检查发生未知错误。请查看 dsh web 日志。": "WeChat was authorized, but the Harness health check thất bại with an không xác định lỗi. Please check the dsh web logs.",
    "微信已授权，但 Harness 健康检查超时。请确认 dsh web 未阻塞。": "WeChat was authorized, but the Harness health check timed out. Please confirm dsh web is not blocked.",
    "微信已授权，但 Harness 健康检查返回服务错误。请查看 dsh web 日志。": "WeChat was authorized, but the Harness health check returned a server lỗi. Please check the dsh web logs.",
    "微信已授权，但 Harness 拒绝了健康检查请求。请查看 dsh web 日志。": "WeChat was authorized, but Harness rejected the health check request. Please check the dsh web logs.",
    "微信已授权，但 Harness 拒绝了本机健康检查。请检查 Host 信任配置。": "WeChat was authorized, but Harness denied the local health check. Check the Host trust cấu hình.",
    "微信已授权，但 Harness 返回了无法识别的响应。请确认 Harness 与插件版本兼容。": "WeChat was authorized, but Harness returned an unrecognized response. Please confirm the Harness and plugin các phiên bản are compatible.",
    "微信已授权，但找不到 Harness 健康检查接口。请确认 Harness 与插件版本兼容。": "WeChat was authorized, but the Harness health check điểm cuối was not found. Please confirm the Harness and plugin các phiên bản are compatible.",
    "微信已授权，但插件无法连接本机 Harness。请检查 dsh web 地址和端口。": "WeChat was authorized, but the plugin could not connect to the local Harness. Please check the dsh web address and port.",
    "微信已授权，但无法初始化账号状态或工作区。请检查 DSH_HOME 和工作区目录。": "WeChat was authorized, but the tài khoản state or không gian làm việc could not be initialized. Please check DSH_HOME and the không gian làm việc các thư mục.",
    "微信已授权，但无法读取现有登录凭据。请检查 DSH 凭据存储。": "WeChat was authorized, but the existing login thông tin xác thực could not be read. Please check the DSH thông tin xác thực store.",
    "微信已授权，但消息连接初始化失败。请查看 dsh web 日志后重试。": "WeChat was authorized, but the tin nhắn kết nối thất bại to initialize. Please check the dsh web logs and thử lại.",
    "微信已授权，但激活过程中发生未知错误。请查看 dsh web 日志。": "WeChat was authorized, but an không xác định lỗi occurred during activation. Please check the dsh web logs.",
    "微信已授权，但登录凭据无法写入 DSH 凭据存储。请检查凭据存储是否可写。": "WeChat was authorized, but the login thông tin xác thực could not be written to the DSH thông tin xác thực store. Please check that the thông tin xác thực store is writable.",
    "微信已授权，但账号配置无法写入本机。请检查 DSH_HOME 目录权限。": "WeChat was authorized, but the tài khoản cấu hình could not be written locally. Please check the DSH_HOME thư mục quyền hạn.",
    "微信已确认，正在启动消息连接": "Confirmed in WeChat. Starting the tin nhắn kết nối",
