    "授权后自动填入": "Filled in after authorization",
    "授权已确认，正在创建钉钉机器人": "Authorized. Đang tạo the DingTalk bot",
    "授权成功，正在接入邮箱…": "Authorized; đang kết nối the mailbox…",
    "授权成功；请填写邮箱地址与允许的发件人后完成接入。": "Authorized. Enter the mailbox address and at least one allowed sender to finish đang kết nối.",
    "授权由钉钉官方页面完成。扫码账号必须已加入一个企业/组织并有权创建机器人；创建成功后，应用凭据会直接写入 Harness Host。": "Authorization is đã hoàn thành on DingTalk’s chính thức page. The tài khoản must belong to an organization and be allowed to tạo bots. Thông tin xác thực are written directly to the Harness Host.",
