    "收到语音消息时转写为文字并按文字流水线处理,答案同时以语音回复;转写失败时降级为仅支持文字/图片/文件的提示。凭据值在插件凭据库里管理,这里只引用环境变量名。": "Voice messages are transcribed to text and processed by the normal text pipeline; the Câu trả lời is also sent as a voice reply. If transcription fails, the bot falls back to the text/image/file-only notice. The credential value lives in the plugin credential store; only the environment variable name is referenced here.",
